Sinerga is an Italian contract manufacturer of cosmetics, medical devices and food supplements, offering as well ready-to-market solutions, including medical devices in MDR. We offer a complete range of solutions including:
- own-branded cosmetic ingredients; 
- formulative R&D experience for the development of personalized finished products; 
- contract manufacturing of cosmetics, food supplements and medical devices in full-service;
- regulatory, marketing and graphic support.  <!--eventid626:Sinerga SpA-->

